  "Start: all cash (CAD) on the first report date; that first report's purchase counts as a band event and is reported separately (initial_*) and excluded from the *_ex_initial per-year averages.",
  "band_events: accepted reports triggered by the drift band or (margin) the assets/equity band; calendar_events: accepted reports triggered only by the quarter-end calendar check.",
  "turnover_pct_nav and est_cost_bps: sums over reports of traded value / pre-trade NAV and estimated cost / pre-trade NAV; est_cost_cad: half-spread + commission + FX conversion cost as estimated by the engine (fills use the same cost model, and the realised NAV change is checked against the estimate).",
  "fx_converted_cad: CAD value of currency converted to fund buys (CAD->USD at the amount of CAD spent, USD->CAD at the USD spent times USDCAD).",
  "alerts_*: number of monthly reports whose drawdown alert was at that level (unit value vs running peak of accepted reports in the throwaway paper log).",
  "Carry between reports: positive CAD cash earns cycle-8 CASH, a CAD margin loan costs cycle-8 MRATE, USD cash earns cycle-8 RF_USD; balances are rounded to cents each month (holdings files carry cents).",
